{"id":"00069","root":"uni00069_1","name":{"ja":"甲河　アスカ","en":"Koukawa Asuka"},"title":{"ja":"【鋼鉄の対魔忍】","en":"【Steel Taimanin】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【鋼鉄の対魔忍】 甲河　アスカ","en":"【Steel Taimanin】 Koukawa Asuka"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin","UFS"],"release":"2018-10-05","limited":false,"characterId":13,"profile":{"ja":"孤高の抜け対魔忍。忍の名門・甲河家の若き当主であり唯一の生き残り。両親を含め一門をエドウィン・ブラックに殺され、アサギに引き取られて育てられる。１４の時には頭角を現し、対魔忍として認められてさくら、紫とともに危険な任務に投入され多くの戦果をあげる。しかし闇の勢力との死闘の中でアサギと対立、命令を無視してエドウィン・ブラックに単身挑むが敗北して両腕両脚に重傷を負い、その後失踪して抜け忍となる。長らく行方不明であった彼女だが、ある時、両腕に義手＜アンドロイド・アーム＞両脚に義足＜アンドロイド・レッグ＞をした姿で復活を果たし、人魔問わず闇の勢力に加担するものを次々と葬ってゆく事に。今ではアサギと並び、闇の者から鋼鉄の死神などと恐れられる存在となる。彼女の両腕の義手には、魔界の医療技術と人の科学技術が融合されたと思われる高度な技術が施されていて生身の腕のように自由自在に、機械アームのようにパワフルで精密に動き、様々な兵器も内蔵されていて、彼女を支える米連系の組織が存在する事が噂されているが定かではない。得物は両義手の中に仕込まれた鎌状の対魔ブレード。","en":"Koukawa Asuka is a lone, rogue Taimanin. She is the young head of the prestigious Kōga ninja family and its sole survivor. After Edwin Black slaughtered her entire clan, including her parents, she was taken in and raised by Asagi. At fourteen she rose to prominence, earning recognition as a Taimanin and, alongside Sakura and Yatsu Murasaki, was deployed on dangerous missions, achieving many victories. During a fierce battle against dark forces she clashed with Asagi, ignored orders, and challenged Edwin Black alone, only to be defeated and suffer severe injuries to both arms and legs. She then disappeared, becoming a rogue ninja. Long thought missing, she later resurfaced equipped with android arms and legs, and now eradicates anyone—human or demon—who aids the darkness. Today she stands beside Asagi, feared by the underworld as a \"steel reaper.\" Her prosthetic arms are said to incorporate advanced technology that fuses Demon Realm medical science with human engineering, granting them the freedom of flesh, the power of machinery, and built-in weaponry; rumors whisper of a U.S.–linked organization backing her, though nothing is confirmed. Her weapon is a scythe-like Taimanin blade hidden within the prosthetic arms."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"手塚りょうこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00069_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1254,2508],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[157,314],"def":[136,272],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","20005"]},{"id":"uni00069_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1908,3816],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[239,478],"def":[197,394],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","20005","20006"]},{"id":"uni00069_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2562,5123],"sp":[350,350],"atk":[321,644],"def":[258,517],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","20005","20006","20007"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},"20005":{"slot":"skill1","id":20005,"name":{"ja":"対魔ブレード"},"hits":3,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"3 enemies: 156% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},"20006":{"slot":"skill2","id":20006,"name":{"ja":"対魔粒子斬"},"hits":3,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力の攻撃を与え、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力の攻撃を与え、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力の攻撃を与え、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力の攻撃を与え、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力の攻撃を与え、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}